	)	(text "TODO(unverified) OPEN-1 5 V RAIL (U2 pin 1 VCC) -- The F33 reaches 2 W/33 dBm @433 only at 5.0 V. The 5 V rail is an open operator item (ADR-029 O5, carried into ADR-034). U2 pin 1 is left with NO net - do not tie a 2 W PA module to 3V3 or to an invented 5 V rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 250 0)
